        "faq-1": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long do the veneers last?",
            "answer": "<p>How long your veneers last depends directly on how you care for and use them day to day. With regular, gentle care they can last a long time.</p><p>To keep them at their best:</p><ul><li>Clean them regularly with a soft toothbrush and lukewarm water (avoid hot water).</li><li>Handle them with care when placing and removing them.</li><li>Store them in their case after each use.</li></ul><p>Careful maintenance is the key to keeping their shine and comfort for as long as possible.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq-2": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How many teeth do they cover?",
            "answer": "<p>Your veneers are designed to cover a full set of your visible teeth — not just a few individual teeth — so you get a harmonious, even smile.</p><p>You choose the upper teeth, the lower teeth, or both depending on the offer. Each piece is <strong>custom-made</strong> from your own impression for a fit tailored to your teeth.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq-3": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How does taking the impression work?",
            "answer": "<p>It’s simple and can be done entirely at home, in a few minutes and without a dentist. You’re guided step by step by our detailed tutorial.</p><p>You’ll find this tutorial in the <strong>“Help &amp; Info” › “Impression”</strong> section of the site.</p><p>Once your impression is done, simply send it back to us: our specialists use it to craft your custom veneers.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq-4": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What if I'm not satisfied?",
            "answer": "<p>Your satisfaction is our priority. You’re covered by our <strong>30-Day Satisfaction Guarantee</strong>.</p><p>If your veneers don’t fit correctly or cause discomfort, contact Clinic Essabar so we can review your case and apply the guarantee in line with our return &amp; refund policy.</p><p>Our team is here to help at every step to find the best solution.</p>"
          }
        },
